              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "व्यायामभूमिः — vyāyāmabhūmiḥ — \"a gymnasium; an exercise ground\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अरुणः प्रतिदिनं व्यायामभूमिं गच्छति। aruṇaḥ pratidinaṃ vyāyāmabhūmiṃ gacchati. Arun goes to the exercise ground every day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "व्यायामभूमिः (vyāyāmabhūmiḥ) is built from vyāyāma, \"exercise\", and bhūmi, \"ground\"; MW gives vyāyāmabhūmi as an exercising ground, a gymnasium (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
